ing division — he has said the idea came up while talking with friends."},{"id":"q6","question":"Which album won him the 2024 Grammy for Best Música Mexicana Album?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Ah y Qué?","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Génesis","is_correct":true},{"id":"c","text":"Efectos Secundarios","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"Éxodo","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"Génesis (2023) took the Grammy at the February 2024 ceremony; Éxodo arrived months later."},{"id":"q7","question":"Who joins him on the hit «La Bebé»?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Rauw Alejandro","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Feid","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"Yng Lvcas","is_correct":true},{"id":"d","text":"Mora","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"La Bebé is his 2023 duet with fellow Mexican artist Yng Lvcas."},{"id":"q8","question":"Which instrument does Peso Pluma play on stage?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Trumpet","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Accordion","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"Drums","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"Guitar","is_correct":true}],"explanation":"He taught himself guitar as a teenager and usually performs with a requinto-style guitar."}]'::jsonb,
